 "range_note": "No 0-5 m samples: KITTI's camera is level with a 28 deg vertical FOV, so the ground is out of frame closer than about 6 m. Near range is covered only by the analytic wearable table.",
 "ttc_note": "Boxes are labels, not detections; the jitter rows add Gaussian noise to box height as a stand-in for detector noise. KITTI ego is a car at up to ~15 m/s: closing speeds and taus differ from walking. GT tau from 3D z includes ego motion, as looming does."
}